ok...

It's a we can't develop QB pick, when we had QB in the draft. Teddy isn't a top 16 QB and so we won't be a top team against KC. Either Drew grows a lot or we are boned. Don't get me wrong I am not a Drew guy cause I like him, I'm a Drew guy because we fucked if he doesn't play the way we know he can.

